Kanashimi ikuta noseshi fune

00:00:29.124 --> 00:00:39.334
Horobi no uta no koe takaku

00:00:44.144 --> 00:00:48.664
Kuraki soko yori

00:00:50.114 --> 00:00:55.214
Ukabi koshi

00:00:59.184 --> 00:01:10.324
Aa kimi to ima shirogane o nuke

00:01:11.134 --> 00:01:22.074
Ozora e futari tobu hi no

00:01:22.074 --> 00:01:36.254
Kuru o yume min, kuru o yume min

00:01:45.534 --> 00:01:47.704
After more than a century of tradition,

00:01:47.704 --> 00:01:48.234
1999 Kaio Academy Average Grades
After more than a century of tradition,

00:01:48.234 --> 00:01:49.704
1999 Kaio Academy Average Grades
the reputation of our venerable
institution is in jeopardy!

00:01:49.704 --> 00:01:50.964
The reputation of our venerable
institution is in jeopardy!

00:01:54.274 --> 00:01:55.674
Disgraceful!

00:01:56.074 --> 00:01:57.844
Do I make myself clear?

00:01:58.814 --> 00:02:02.384
The grade point average this semester
has declined severely!

00:02:02.384 --> 00:02:06.014
All students should be confined to the
dormitories during the summer holiday!

00:02:07.124 --> 00:02:10.024
...I'm afraid it's official!

00:02:12.264 --> 00:02:15.924
Don't worry. As long as you pass
your exams, you're in the clear!

00:02:17.334 --> 00:02:18.804
Are you worried?

00:02:19.634 --> 00:02:20.574
About what?

00:02:20.574 --> 00:02:22.624
Your ranking as top student!

00:02:23.544 --> 00:02:25.834
My ranking?

00:02:26.044 --> 00:02:27.704
Now that I'm here...

00:02:31.744 --> 00:02:35.454
All right, everyone!
Good luck on your exams tomorrow!

00:02:35.454 --> 00:02:37.054
Yes, ma'am.

00:02:37.054 --> 00:02:38.174
Yes, ma'am!

00:02:39.154 --> 00:02:41.744
Little eyes.

00:02:44.024 --> 00:02:46.324
Is it already that time of year?

00:02:46.324 --> 00:02:49.924
Now that exams are over, it really
feels like summer, doesn't it?

00:02:50.434 --> 00:02:52.404
How were your grades?

00:02:53.734 --> 00:02:56.934
Oh, a little bit above the middle range, I guess!

00:02:57.244 --> 00:02:59.904
Yeah. I think mine were, too.

00:03:05.644 --> 00:03:06.844
Mari?

00:03:06.984 --> 00:03:09.214
What's with her?

00:03:13.754 --> 00:03:16.484
The lowest score by a mile!

00:03:17.494 --> 00:03:20.084
In my subject, too!

00:03:20.734 --> 00:03:22.434
I'm sorry.

00:03:22.434 --> 00:03:28.394
Well, you just transferred here,
and you never studied chemistry at home...

00:03:29.704 --> 00:03:33.344
Don't worry. If you pass the retake next week,

00:03:33.344 --> 00:03:35.534
you'll still get your summer holiday.

00:03:36.444 --> 00:03:41.644
I'll give you extra help to make
sure you get your vacation. Okay?

00:03:43.724 --> 00:03:44.954
Teacher...

00:03:44.954 --> 00:03:46.114
Yes?

00:03:46.484 --> 00:03:48.424
Why are you so nice to me?

00:03:48.824 --> 00:03:55.454
If you fail, who do you think has to
hang around all summer tutoring you?

00:03:56.164 --> 00:03:59.694
I-I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:04:00.004 --> 00:04:02.164
Hey, I'm kidding!

00:04:02.804 --> 00:04:04.604
Let's both give it our best!

00:04:05.844 --> 00:04:07.174
Right?

00:04:10.944 --> 00:04:12.474
Right!

00:04:12.944 --> 00:04:14.314
Huh?!

00:04:14.314 --> 00:04:15.684
You flunked?

00:04:16.554 --> 00:04:18.784
At chemistry?

00:04:18.784 --> 00:04:23.384
I thought your tutor said you were a genius?

00:04:23.664 --> 00:04:27.064
Well, actually, that was in physics...

00:04:27.564 --> 00:04:30.694
Who mixes up chemistry with physics?!

00:04:31.064 --> 00:04:33.004
You really are dumb!

00:04:34.374 --> 00:04:35.664
Shut up!

00:04:35.874 --> 00:04:38.674
I hope you pass the retest!

00:04:38.874 --> 00:04:41.464
Why not have Hagino tutor you?

00:04:42.144 --> 00:04:44.974
Yeah! She's number one in the whole school!

00:04:45.544 --> 00:04:47.054
Miss Senkoji...

00:04:47.054 --> 00:04:48.484
Please!

00:04:48.984 --> 00:04:51.054
I'm failing math!

00:04:51.054 --> 00:04:52.784
I'm failing English!

00:04:52.784 --> 00:04:55.984
I'm failing Modern Japan and Classics!

00:04:56.324 --> 00:04:58.824
Please help us, Lady Hagino!

00:04:58.824 --> 00:05:00.594
Me, too!

00:05:00.594 --> 00:05:01.894
Please!

00:05:02.164 --> 00:05:05.364
All right. One by one, now!

00:05:05.604 --> 00:05:07.864
There sure are a lot of morons!

00:05:08.604 --> 00:05:11.094
No wonder Ms. Maiyama's up in arms!

00:05:12.174 --> 00:05:14.874
Whatever. I don't need her help!

00:05:16.114 --> 00:05:20.574
We now have clear evidence
of Ship Five's mutiny.

00:05:21.284 --> 00:05:26.584
It's up to us to quell this insubordination
before the main fleet arrives.

00:05:26.994 --> 00:05:32.584
To that end, Ships Three and Four will wage
a joint offensive on the rebel ship!

00:05:33.664 --> 00:05:36.194
It's in your hands, Azanael!

00:05:36.194 --> 00:05:37.494
Yes, Ma'am!

00:05:41.074 --> 00:05:43.034
Music Room

00:05:55.354 --> 00:05:57.414
Teacher? I don't get this...

00:05:57.624 --> 00:06:00.414
Hmm? Let's see...

00:06:01.794 --> 00:06:04.284
The part about the properties of a gas...

00:06:07.794 --> 00:06:09.454
No, this is wrong.

00:06:09.994 --> 00:06:15.464
When you collect a gas that isn't water soluble,
you use water displacement.

00:06:16.034 --> 00:06:20.104
Upward displacement is when you...

00:06:21.814 --> 00:06:22.804
Hey...

00:06:23.644 --> 00:06:25.014
Focus!

00:06:28.514 --> 00:06:38.184
So, "if temperature is constant, the pressure on a
gas and its volume are inversely proportional."

00:06:40.964 --> 00:06:49.034
Two households, both alike in dignity,
In fair Verona, where we lay our scene,

00:06:49.034 --> 00:06:54.844
From ancient grudge break to new mutiny,
Where civil blood...

00:07:03.184 --> 00:07:05.524
Mari! You're still up?

00:07:05.524 --> 00:07:09.384
Yeah. How 'bout you, Michi?
Working on the play?

00:07:09.524 --> 00:07:16.264
Yes. I've never written a play before.
I have no idea what to write!

00:07:16.494 --> 00:07:18.624
Oh. That's tough!

00:07:19.634 --> 00:07:23.504
I'd like to at least settle on the general
plot before summer vacation...

00:07:24.344 --> 00:07:30.104
I think you should write the play
you'd most like to watch, Michi!

00:07:31.144 --> 00:07:32.774
You're right.

00:07:34.954 --> 00:07:36.684
How's the studying going?

00:07:36.684 --> 00:07:41.124
Hmm... It's going okay, I guess.

00:07:42.354 --> 00:07:46.554
Miss Sugawara has been helping me a lot.

00:07:47.764 --> 00:07:52.364
I'm sure you'll feel better when it's all
over and you can go see the fireworks!

00:07:52.604 --> 00:07:53.794
Fireworks?

00:07:54.834 --> 00:07:58.234
The Kaio firework show is a big event!

00:07:58.774 --> 00:08:03.074
There's all kinds of vendors, and people
come from all around to watch.

00:08:03.074 --> 00:08:04.704
Is that so?

00:08:05.744 --> 00:08:07.374
Fireworks...

00:08:11.224 --> 00:08:12.944
We're ordered to disarm?

00:08:13.424 --> 00:08:16.514
Ships Three and Four are in transit.

00:08:17.424 --> 00:08:20.794
They're making their move.

00:08:26.264 --> 00:08:28.404
Does everyone remember the three values

00:08:28.404 --> 00:08:30.994
I emphasized to you at the
beginning of the semester?

00:08:31.204 --> 00:08:34.474
Yes. Motivation, perseverance, and fortitude!

00:08:34.774 --> 00:08:40.084
As you begin your summer holidays, I hope
you'll all remember these three principles.

00:08:40.084 --> 00:08:40.754
11th Grade Cherry Blossoms

00:08:40.754 --> 00:08:45.284
11th Grade Cherry Blossoms
Take care of yourselves over the holiday,
everyone! And don't forget your homework!

00:08:45.284 --> 00:08:45.424
11th Grade Cherry Blossoms

00:08:45.424 --> 00:08:46.524
11th Grade Cherry Blossoms
Yes, Ma'am!

00:08:46.524 --> 00:08:46.984
Yes, Ma'am!

00:08:47.524 --> 00:08:48.754
Miss Wakatake?

00:08:49.954 --> 00:08:52.424
Please come see me in the chemistry lab later.

00:08:56.234 --> 00:08:57.564
Excuse me...

00:08:59.464 --> 00:09:01.764
Oh! Come on in!

00:09:02.504 --> 00:09:03.634
Here you go!

00:09:09.214 --> 00:09:12.344
Tomorrow's the day. How's your confidence?

00:09:12.584 --> 00:09:15.344
Well... not so great.

00:09:15.654 --> 00:09:19.484
Don't worry. You've really
studied hard this week!

00:09:20.124 --> 00:09:21.984
I wanted to celebrate your hard work!

00:09:23.094 --> 00:09:24.294
Teacher?

00:09:24.294 --> 00:09:25.224
Yes?

00:09:25.224 --> 00:09:30.684
After the retake... can I go see the fireworks?

00:09:30.934 --> 00:09:34.164
Yes, of course. Why?

00:09:35.104 --> 00:09:36.364
Well...

00:09:40.474 --> 00:09:45.274
Could the two of us... go together?

00:09:45.984 --> 00:09:47.774
You and I?

00:09:51.524 --> 00:09:55.454
Sure. After the retake, we'll go see the fireworks!

00:09:57.464 --> 00:09:58.584
Yes!

00:09:59.394 --> 00:10:02.264
Speaking of which, do you have a yukata, Mari?

00:10:02.264 --> 00:10:03.164
No...

00:10:03.164 --> 00:10:11.334
Then I'll bring you one I wore when I was
younger. I can help you get dressed, too.

00:10:12.144 --> 00:10:13.334
A yukata!

00:10:14.544 --> 00:10:16.304
Now, what about your hair?

00:10:16.774 --> 00:10:18.374
Hold still a minute.

00:10:20.284 --> 00:10:21.804
Teacher?

00:10:23.114 --> 00:10:24.744
That should do it!

00:10:25.724 --> 00:10:28.654
Ooh, Mari, you're adorable!

00:10:30.324 --> 00:10:32.384
R-really?

00:10:36.494 --> 00:10:39.634
Well? How are you settling in at school?

00:10:39.634 --> 00:10:40.534
Hmm?

00:10:40.534 --> 00:10:44.774
After all, you've been with your
grandmother all this time,

00:10:44.774 --> 00:10:50.234
and you've never lived with other
girls before, let alone boarding school!

00:10:50.844 --> 00:10:52.574
I worried about you!

00:10:55.414 --> 00:10:57.044
Teacher Yuko...

00:11:14.174 --> 00:11:15.794
Good luck!

00:11:17.074 --> 00:11:20.534
Final Exam
Retake Waiting Room

00:11:21.144 --> 00:11:22.204
How was it?

00:11:22.944 --> 00:11:24.844
I think I failed!

00:11:27.454 --> 00:11:32.414
Math retake students, proceed to the next room!

00:11:34.694 --> 00:11:35.484
Retake Exam Schedule
English
Modern Japan
Classics
Math
Chemistry

00:11:36.894 --> 00:11:38.124
Chemistry

00:11:39.164 --> 00:11:40.424
There she is!

00:11:41.794 --> 00:11:43.694
Good luck, failure girl!

00:11:44.104 --> 00:11:46.194
You'd better pass this time, or else!

00:11:47.304 --> 00:11:49.634
Afterwards, we'll all go see the
fireworks together, okay?

00:11:49.904 --> 00:11:52.774
Miss Senkoji promised to join us later, too!

00:11:53.574 --> 00:11:54.844
You guys...

00:11:54.844 --> 00:11:58.834
We're going to head over first... hey!

00:11:58.984 --> 00:12:00.484
Yes! Go on ahead!

00:12:00.484 --> 00:12:02.054
Hey, where are you going?

00:12:02.054 --> 00:12:03.614
The exam starts soon!

00:12:03.614 --> 00:12:05.554
I promise I'll be there!

00:12:06.684 --> 00:12:08.254
Chemistry Lab

00:12:08.254 --> 00:12:10.294
Chemistry Lab
You really shouldn't have come here.

00:12:10.294 --> 00:12:10.584
Chemistry Lab

00:12:10.664 --> 00:12:14.684
The higher-ups have great faith in your abilities.

00:12:15.134 --> 00:12:17.324
I have to tell Teacher Yuko...

00:12:17.564 --> 00:12:20.624
We'll all go see the fireworks together!

00:12:21.674 --> 00:12:24.074
The wholesale homicidal frenzy
of those islanders,

00:12:24.574 --> 00:12:27.164
and that bizarrely localized tsunami!

00:12:28.244 --> 00:12:29.334
On top of that,

00:12:29.744 --> 00:12:32.774
a mysterious incident was reported
in the vicinity recently.

00:12:34.554 --> 00:12:37.454
As it stands, we don't have a single clue.

00:12:39.584 --> 00:12:41.414
As you well know,

00:12:41.794 --> 00:12:45.294
We'll never uncover the truth behind
the Kamioka Island disaster

00:12:45.294 --> 00:12:48.734
unless the subject recovers her memory.

00:12:49.834 --> 00:12:51.294
Teacher Yuko?

00:12:51.364 --> 00:12:53.634
Tonight, let's all go together to...

00:13:00.444 --> 00:13:01.374
I know.

00:13:01.714 --> 00:13:05.164
I'm keeping Mari Wakatake
under close observation.

00:13:05.644 --> 00:13:10.054
She is the key to this investigation, after all.

00:13:11.424 --> 00:13:12.974
Keep up the good work.

00:13:19.564 --> 00:13:22.364
Investigator Sagara? Is something wrong?

00:13:23.464 --> 00:13:25.124
Investigator?

00:13:26.034 --> 00:13:26.864
No...

00:13:27.634 --> 00:13:29.624
It's nothing.

00:13:38.644 --> 00:13:40.344
Any message from Novaal?

00:13:40.854 --> 00:13:43.414
Yes. The co-ordinates...

00:13:44.484 --> 00:13:45.714
That's strange...

00:13:47.894 --> 00:13:52.754
I don't suppose they intend to
expose us to the Forimes?

00:13:53.764 --> 00:13:55.734
Commander?

00:13:56.164 --> 00:13:59.104
Should we comply with the order to disarm?

00:13:59.834 --> 00:14:03.274
I'm afraid that's out of the question.

00:14:03.974 --> 00:14:05.274
Of course...

00:14:05.844 --> 00:14:09.934
For now, let's proceed to the specified point
and await their next move.

00:14:10.214 --> 00:14:13.074
Roger. Blue, take off.

00:14:13.744 --> 00:14:15.414
Blue, taking off.

00:14:30.194 --> 00:14:31.494
Observing me!

00:14:32.334 --> 00:14:34.524
She was observing me!

00:14:40.474 --> 00:14:42.674
Ship Three is ready to fire!

00:14:43.344 --> 00:14:46.104
Ship Four is nearing firing range!

00:14:46.784 --> 00:14:49.474
Ship Five, Blue, is approaching
the rendezvous point!

00:14:59.494 --> 00:15:01.584
Mari!

00:15:04.634 --> 00:15:06.494
Mari!

00:15:09.534 --> 00:15:11.364
Wait, Mari!

00:15:11.674 --> 00:15:12.974
Stay away!

00:15:13.104 --> 00:15:14.544
Mari!

00:15:22.414 --> 00:15:24.644
I wonder what happened to Mari?

00:15:24.924 --> 00:15:26.854
Hagino hasn't shown up either...

00:15:26.984 --> 00:15:29.214
They're probably fighting again!

00:15:31.564 --> 00:15:32.614
All right!

00:15:38.704 --> 00:15:41.264
Launching fighter squadrons one and two!

00:15:55.054 --> 00:15:57.784
Enemy interceptors approaching
from orbital altitude.

00:15:57.784 --> 00:15:58.984
Already?

00:15:59.454 --> 00:16:02.254
Prepare for air battle. Release interceptors.

00:16:19.244 --> 00:16:20.534
Fire!

00:16:31.324 --> 00:16:35.484
Warning. High energy beam artillery detected.

00:16:42.934 --> 00:16:44.534
Wow!

00:16:44.534 --> 00:16:47.194
They're really spectacular this year!

00:16:51.604 --> 00:16:56.204
Just because I survived the
Kamioka Island disaster?

00:16:56.374 --> 00:16:59.074
You were observing me for an investigation?

00:16:59.514 --> 00:17:03.214
To see if I remembered something?

00:17:03.684 --> 00:17:05.514
Calm down, Mari!

00:17:05.724 --> 00:17:07.274
This whole time...

00:17:07.654 --> 00:17:09.284
It was all lies!

00:17:10.054 --> 00:17:11.154
This school...

00:17:11.294 --> 00:17:12.594
The girls in the dorm...

00:17:14.024 --> 00:17:16.524
Was it all lies?

00:17:17.964 --> 00:17:19.624
Mari...

00:17:42.354 --> 00:17:43.454
This is...

00:17:44.594 --> 00:17:46.494
It's all a trap.

00:17:46.494 --> 00:17:47.424
Mari...

00:17:47.424 --> 00:17:48.794
No!

00:18:26.664 --> 00:18:28.394
Listen to me, Mari.

00:18:30.434 --> 00:18:35.064
My assignment is to investigate
and monitor you...

00:18:37.714 --> 00:18:38.944
And also...

00:18:45.554 --> 00:18:46.914
Teacher...

00:18:50.224 --> 00:18:52.194
To protect you!

00:18:54.394 --> 00:18:55.694
That monkey!

00:18:59.334 --> 00:19:00.394
Teacher!

00:19:03.734 --> 00:19:04.834
What?!

00:19:09.074 --> 00:19:10.374
Ekaril?!

00:19:15.884 --> 00:19:19.154
And now, the moment we've all been waiting for!

00:19:19.154 --> 00:19:23.144
The grand finale of our show!

00:19:27.894 --> 00:19:29.324
Watch this!

00:19:31.864 --> 00:19:34.464
S-field artillery, lock released.

00:19:34.974 --> 00:19:39.434
Energy management complete.
Target on axis line.

00:19:39.544 --> 00:19:42.104
Now... I have permission!

00:19:42.414 --> 00:19:43.674
Firing.

00:19:59.064 --> 00:20:00.594
All units directly hit!

00:20:00.594 --> 00:20:02.964
Engine damaged... unable to attack!

00:20:03.694 --> 00:20:07.724
Precision shooting... from that distance?!

00:20:08.474 --> 00:20:11.164
Ships Three and Four, retreat!

00:20:11.244 --> 00:20:15.934
Roger. Ships Erbol and Shubel are ordered
to retreat immediately to base.

00:20:16.514 --> 00:20:21.714
Master Commander?
I have a message from Ship Five.

00:20:21.714 --> 00:20:22.684
Read it.

00:20:22.684 --> 00:20:23.814
But...

00:20:23.814 --> 00:20:25.414
Go on.

00:20:25.724 --> 00:20:27.024
Well then...

00:20:27.024 --> 00:20:30.894
From Ship Five, to Master Commander.

00:20:31.524 --> 00:20:39.124
"We reject your order to disarm. This vessel will
hereby conduct itself independently."

00:20:39.404 --> 00:20:40.264
Thank you.

00:20:40.264 --> 00:20:41.494
Yes, Ma'am.

00:21:02.324 --> 00:21:04.584
Teacher? Are you hurt?

00:21:04.894 --> 00:21:06.194
I'm fine.

00:21:07.824 --> 00:21:13.394
Even though it was my job,
I apologize for deceiving you.

00:21:14.804 --> 00:21:16.964
I'm sorry, Mari.

00:21:22.474 --> 00:21:23.844
But one thing.

00:21:23.914 --> 00:21:26.674
Don't run away from yourself.

00:21:26.884 --> 00:21:30.684
That's my final advice as your teacher.

00:21:33.754 --> 00:21:35.554
Final?

00:21:36.994 --> 00:21:40.954
I'm not much of a secret investigator
now that my cover's blown.

00:21:41.934 --> 00:21:46.524
Next semester, I'm sure
they'll send a replacement...

00:21:47.404 --> 00:21:48.634
No!

00:21:48.734 --> 00:21:49.734
Mari?

00:21:49.734 --> 00:21:54.904
Teacher Yuko! You may be a secret
something-or-other...

00:21:55.774 --> 00:21:57.834
But you're my teacher, aren't you?

00:21:58.284 --> 00:22:01.474
Yes, I am.

00:22:02.254 --> 00:22:03.714
Well, then...

00:22:03.884 --> 00:22:07.324
Stay here and teach me till the end!

00:22:07.484 --> 00:22:08.714
Teacher!

00:22:09.694 --> 00:22:11.024
Mari...

00:22:14.124 --> 00:22:19.434
Okay, but if you ever fail another test,
you're in for it!

00:22:26.244 --> 00:22:29.234
I'm taking you prisoner.

00:22:30.914 --> 00:22:32.314
Do as you like!

00:22:40.784 --> 00:22:42.794
So? How were the retakes?

00:22:42.794 --> 00:22:45.954
They're having a re-retake just for Wakatake.

00:22:46.464 --> 00:22:48.394
I swear, that girl...

00:22:53.804 --> 00:22:56.564
I hope you make top rank!

00:22:56.774 --> 00:22:57.674
Shut up!

00:22:57.674 --> 00:23:00.644
What was that, Miss Wakatake? This is an exam!

00:23:00.944 --> 00:23:02.274
Yes, Ma'am.

00:23:02.374 --> 00:23:05.714
I'm afraid you're not taking
this seriously, young lady!

00:23:09.254 --> 00:23:12.084
The play I most want to see...

00:23:13.554 --> 00:23:17.324
What'll I do?

00:23:29.534 --> 00:23:37.004
Futari narande te o tsunaida sora ni

00:23:37.814 --> 00:23:47.854
Mirai kasane chikau ano chiheisen

00:23:47.854 --> 00:23:55.524
Kaze ga yasashiku fuki nuketeku youni

00:23:56.234 --> 00:24:04.104
Bokura asu e toketetta

00:24:04.704 --> 00:24:08.314
Nagarete ku toki wa tada

00:24:08.314 --> 00:24:13.644
Shizuka ni kimi wo mimamotte

00:24:13.844 --> 00:24:17.584
Kanashimi mo "Sayonara" mo

00:24:17.584 --> 00:24:23.084
Aoi namida mo tsuyosa ni naru

00:24:24.424 --> 00:24:28.734
Bokura yume kakeru tsubomi

00:24:28.734 --> 00:24:33.564
Kotae sagashi ikiteku

00:24:33.564 --> 00:24:37.874
Hokori takaku saku hana ni

00:24:37.874 --> 00:24:43.574
Itsuka wa nareru to shinjiteta

00:24:43.574 --> 00:24:47.534
In the blue dreams!

00:25:02.134 --> 00:25:07.564
Mari and friends visit Dorm Chief Funatsumaru's
home for the summer holidays.

00:25:08.204 --> 00:25:14.504
Hagino spends a stormy night with
a young girl she encounters there...

00:25:15.544 --> 00:25:21.604
An innocent being that is baffling to an Arume.

00:25:22.984 --> 00:25:27.084
Next time on Blue Drop: Crinum.
